WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.705 --> 01:38.905
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:54.225 --> 01:58.065
TREAT EVERY DAY SERIOUSLY
EVERY DAY WILL BE BETTER

02:04.705 --> 02:05.985
GOT BACK TO CLIENT ON BUDGET TODAY

02:06.065 --> 02:07.225
FOLLOW UP ON DESIGN DRAFT

02:07.305 --> 02:08.505
UPDATE PLANNING DIVISION
CLIENT POSTPONES PRESENTATION TO MONDAY

02:08.584 --> 02:09.744
COMPILE TIANYUE PROJECT SUMMARY REPORT

02:09.825 --> 02:10.505
REPORT LACKS: 1. COMPETITIVE ANALYSIS
2. CHANGE IN MARKET SHARE

02:10.584 --> 02:11.225
3. DATA SUPPORT
4. RISK ASSESSMENT

02:26.625 --> 02:27.985
WORKPLACE VIBE IMPROVEMENT PLAN

02:28.065 --> 02:30.825
SPEECH HABITS, BODY LANGUAGE
MENTALITY ADJUSTMENT

02:32.785 --> 02:33.985
COMMUNICATION SKILLS

02:34.065 --> 02:37.105
TODAY'S OBSERVATION, LEARNING PLAN

02:48.185 --> 02:51.665
CAN YOU CONTROL THE FEELING OF LOVE?

02:56.265 --> 02:58.545
I got this from saving you.

02:58.625 --> 03:01.585
In ancient times, you'd have to…

03:09.905 --> 03:11.305
Marry me.

03:26.745 --> 03:27.745
Shang Zhitao.

04:24.945 --> 04:28.305
Your eyebrows. Why do you always frown?

04:29.025 --> 04:30.185
Are you tired?

04:38.465 --> 04:39.505
Come home with me.

04:57.145 --> 04:58.225
What's going on?

05:00.025 --> 05:00.865
Come on. Give it to me.

05:04.705 --> 05:06.145
Nothing. It's…

05:06.825 --> 05:08.305
I sprained my ankle.

05:08.905 --> 05:09.785
Is it serious?

05:09.865 --> 05:11.025
-Do you need to go to the hospital?
-It's not.

05:11.105 --> 05:12.185
It's fine. No need to go to the hospital.

05:15.825 --> 05:16.745
What happened?

05:18.305 --> 05:19.825
Today

05:21.305 --> 05:23.665
isn't my day.

05:28.385 --> 05:29.505
The event was ruined.

05:30.665 --> 05:34.145
One of our customers
already has a boyfriend,

05:34.225 --> 05:36.465
but she still joined our event.

05:37.225 --> 05:38.225
In the end,

05:38.745 --> 05:43.265
her boyfriend came to the venue
and made a mess out of it.

05:43.785 --> 05:46.985
I wanted to say something to comfort her,

05:47.065 --> 05:51.625
but she pushed me down on the ground.

05:52.225 --> 05:55.985
I sprained my ankle, and it hurts.

06:08.185 --> 06:09.425
Don't catch a cold.

06:10.465 --> 06:11.505
Go back first.

06:17.225 --> 06:18.065
Let's go.

06:21.465 --> 06:23.905
-Did I get it dirty?
-It's fine. Slow down.

06:29.745 --> 06:31.185
Give me a hand.

06:33.465 --> 06:34.305
Come.

06:50.185 --> 06:51.265
Come inside.

06:54.705 --> 06:55.545
Fish.

06:57.945 --> 06:58.905
Come here.

07:39.065 --> 07:39.905
Hello?

07:40.585 --> 07:42.105
<i>Where are you?</i>

07:42.185 --> 07:44.265
We are going to the next place now.

07:44.345 --> 07:45.345
We want to keep drinking at your home.

07:45.425 --> 07:46.705
Luan Nian, we are going to your home.

07:46.785 --> 07:48.705
We are going to keep celebrating!

07:48.785 --> 07:50.025
Don't come.

07:50.105 --> 07:51.145
Go back to your own homes.

07:51.225 --> 07:52.465
I don't welcome anyone.

08:10.865 --> 08:11.705
SUN YUANZHU

08:26.705 --> 08:27.665
She's still not answering?

09:25.865 --> 09:26.905
Luan Nian?

09:30.345 --> 09:31.305
Luke.

09:32.145 --> 09:33.265
Where am I?

09:34.345 --> 09:35.345
This is my house.

09:46.785 --> 09:47.625
Thank you.

09:49.625 --> 09:52.465
You were drunk
and couldn't say your address clearly.

09:53.185 --> 09:54.865
I had to bring you here

09:54.945 --> 09:57.385
and wait for you to sober up
before sending you home.

10:06.545 --> 10:09.465
Sorry for troubling you.

10:10.025 --> 10:11.425
Did I embarrass myself

10:12.665 --> 10:14.105
when I was drunk?

10:15.865 --> 10:16.705
You did.

10:27.505 --> 10:30.665
You spouted nonsense and confessed to me.

10:32.345 --> 10:34.105
You wanted me to marry you.

10:34.985 --> 10:37.345
Don't… Don't believe anything I said.

10:37.425 --> 10:41.945
They say the words you say
when you're drunk are all nonsense.

10:42.545 --> 10:45.025
When I am sober,
I've never thought about this.

10:51.945 --> 10:53.105
Are you single?

10:57.305 --> 10:58.345
Yes.

11:00.225 --> 11:01.345
Why don't we give it a try?

11:05.665 --> 11:06.865
No…

11:06.945 --> 11:08.105
There's no need.

11:09.065 --> 11:10.305
When it comes to thoughts

11:11.865 --> 11:14.385
that I shouldn't be having,
I can control them really well.

11:28.705 --> 11:31.225
Can you control the feeling of love?

11:42.225 --> 11:43.745
I'm going to the toilet.

12:15.585 --> 12:16.825
Are you going to my room?

12:21.185 --> 12:22.225
The toilet is on the right.

13:48.745 --> 13:50.105
Get changed.

13:50.185 --> 13:51.265
You'll feel more comfortable.

13:52.385 --> 13:53.545
Thank you.

14:08.105 --> 14:11.545
LONG ZHENTIAN

14:11.625 --> 14:13.545
Zhentian. Are you guys still outside?

14:13.625 --> 14:15.065
<i>I went home.</i>

14:15.145 --> 14:20.225
<i>Shang Zhitao met someone called Luke</i>
<i>at the bar a few hours ago.</i>

14:20.305 --> 14:21.865
<i>He asked her to work overtime.</i>

14:21.945 --> 14:23.105
Work overtime?

14:23.185 --> 14:27.745
<i>Yes. It was very unreasonable,</i>
<i>but Flora agreed.</i>

14:28.505 --> 14:30.825
All right. Rest early.

14:48.425 --> 14:50.465
<i>We're in the same boat.</i>

14:50.985 --> 14:52.185
<i>Let me dress the wound for you.</i>

14:52.865 --> 14:54.865
<i>I've been dreaming about you lately.</i>

14:54.945 --> 14:57.785
<i>In ancient times, you'd have to…</i>

14:59.025 --> 15:00.785
Marry me.

16:50.265 --> 16:51.305
<i>Have you finally realized?</i>

16:52.505 --> 16:54.105
<i>You can't control the feeling of love.</i>

17:07.625 --> 17:09.224
Your phone has been ringing all night.

17:10.145 --> 17:11.184
Answer it.

17:16.065 --> 17:17.224
-Hi, Sun Yu.
-<i>Tao.</i>

17:17.865 --> 17:18.944
You scared me.

17:19.025 --> 17:21.184
Sun Yuanzhu and I
almost called the police.

17:21.265 --> 17:22.825
<i>Where are you? We'll go pick you up.</i>

17:23.625 --> 17:24.704
No need.

17:25.305 --> 17:26.545
I can go back on my own.

17:27.385 --> 17:28.545
I'll take you home later.

17:30.105 --> 17:32.265
Why do I hear a man's voice?

17:32.985 --> 17:34.545
<i>Tao, are you safe?</i>

17:34.625 --> 17:35.705
<i>You must be safe.</i>

17:36.225 --> 17:37.185
<i>If you are in danger,</i>

17:37.265 --> 17:38.185
-I'm safe.
-<i>tap the phone.</i>

17:39.385 --> 17:40.985
I'm very safe.

17:41.065 --> 17:43.745
<i>Long Zhentian said a man called Luke</i>

17:43.825 --> 17:47.505
<i>took you away when you were at the bar.</i>

17:47.585 --> 17:50.105
Is Luke Luan Nian?

17:56.385 --> 17:57.345
It's him.

17:57.425 --> 17:58.345
<i>Got it.</i>

17:58.425 --> 18:00.345
<i>The rain is heavy outside.</i>
<i>It'll be hard to get a taxi.</i>

18:00.425 --> 18:03.145
<i>If you're coming back tomorrow,</i>
<i>remember to stay safe</i>

18:03.225 --> 18:04.225
<i>and protect yourself.</i>

18:04.305 --> 18:05.505
<i>All right. I'm hanging up.</i>

18:16.185 --> 18:17.025
Are you going back?

18:19.945 --> 18:21.585
It's raining outside.
You can't get a taxi easily.

18:22.225 --> 18:23.465
I drank, so I can't drive.

18:24.585 --> 18:25.585
Besides, your friend said

18:26.545 --> 18:27.905
it'd be troublesome
to get a taxi when it was raining.

18:27.985 --> 18:29.585
You can go back tomorrow.

18:36.865 --> 18:37.785
Sure.

18:42.225 --> 18:43.225
Shang Zhitao,

18:45.905 --> 18:47.465
are you sober now?

18:50.625 --> 18:52.425
Do you know what will happen next?

22:27.425 --> 22:28.505
<i>Thanks for last night.</i>

22:44.065 --> 22:45.505
<i>Welcome to the weather forecast.</i>

22:45.585 --> 22:48.305
<i>Today is April 12th, 2013.</i>

22:48.385 --> 22:50.145
<i>Beijing is cloudy, but turning clear.</i>

22:50.225 --> 22:52.825
<i>The temperature is around</i>
<i>23 degrees Celsius.</i>

22:52.905 --> 22:55.905
<i>Last night's storm brought</i>
<i>a good amount of nutrients to plants.</i>

22:55.985 --> 22:58.505
<i>There's sufficient sunlight today</i>
<i>with average humidity levels.</i>

23:32.145 --> 23:34.065
LUAN NIAN: IT'S NOTHING MUCH

23:39.465 --> 23:40.505
Hello.

23:51.345 --> 23:52.585
Is she from 2501?

23:53.425 --> 23:54.625
It's none of your business.

23:55.305 --> 23:56.145
Get back in your position.

24:16.785 --> 24:18.505
Today's weather sure is nice.

24:18.585 --> 24:20.145
The sun is shining brightly.

24:27.865 --> 24:28.825
Yes.

24:30.305 --> 24:31.625
How can the morning sun

24:33.505 --> 24:35.065
be so pretty?

25:40.145 --> 25:40.985
Great.

25:41.585 --> 25:42.785
You're giving me the silent treatment.

25:47.985 --> 25:49.585
You're a jerk.

25:49.665 --> 25:51.265
Why did you leave in a rush yesterday?

25:51.345 --> 25:54.065
You didn't even take your jacket
or drive your car.

25:54.585 --> 25:56.265
I had to deliver them to you.

26:23.145 --> 26:24.065
You're back.

26:31.585 --> 26:33.545
You're quite open-minded, Shang Zhitao.

26:33.625 --> 26:34.905
It was an accident.

26:35.505 --> 26:37.105
I know it was an accident for you.

26:37.625 --> 26:39.145
What about Luan Nian?

26:39.225 --> 26:40.465
Was it the same for him?

26:41.025 --> 26:42.265
I guess it counts as an accident.

26:43.985 --> 26:45.305
That's great.

26:46.185 --> 26:48.945
Men and women in this city
have happy accidents every day.

26:49.025 --> 26:49.945
It's a good thing.

26:50.025 --> 26:51.985
My hunch is always accurate.

26:52.065 --> 26:55.425
When you first
brought that girl to my place,

26:55.505 --> 26:58.745
I knew there would be a spark
between you two.

26:58.825 --> 27:00.745
You must have been planning this
for a long time.

27:00.825 --> 27:04.945
He first saved your life
and then created an accident.

27:05.025 --> 27:05.905
In my opinion,

27:05.985 --> 27:09.625
he has been advancing step by step
for a long time.

27:11.145 --> 27:13.585
Don't make it sound like he's a jerk.

27:13.665 --> 27:15.425
I still respect him a lot.

27:15.505 --> 27:17.065
Respect? What kind of respect?

27:17.145 --> 27:18.785
Bowing to him on the bed?

27:18.865 --> 27:19.705
Enough…

27:21.305 --> 27:23.465
I have no interest in spending time
and energy to date someone.

27:24.065 --> 27:25.705
You don't date people, indeed.

27:25.785 --> 27:27.225
Girls are the ones
throwing themselves at you.

27:31.625 --> 27:33.785
She's really not the type
to throw herself at someone.

27:40.425 --> 27:42.265
Then you've got to tell me about that.

27:44.985 --> 27:47.945
So, what kind of person is she?

27:49.505 --> 27:51.265
<i>Even among us,</i>
<i>people can be very different.</i>

27:51.345 --> 27:54.945
The ideas he comes up with in 0.1 seconds
can satisfy the clients.

27:55.905 --> 27:57.025
He is talented

27:57.105 --> 28:00.865
and has become an expert in this industry
at such a young age.

28:00.945 --> 28:04.145
Any ordinary person
will need ten years, at least,

28:04.225 --> 28:06.025
to reach his position.

28:06.105 --> 28:07.865
I get it now.

28:07.945 --> 28:10.665
Men who are outstanding at work
are indeed charming.

28:13.065 --> 28:14.865
What about his life?
How is his private life?

28:23.945 --> 28:26.785
I think he's a bit lonely.

28:29.345 --> 28:31.945
Shang Zhitao, you're done for.

28:32.985 --> 28:34.865
When you unknowingly feel sorry for a man,

28:34.945 --> 28:38.185
it's the beginning
of falling wholeheartedly in love.

28:38.705 --> 28:43.265
I really think Ms. Shang
is different from all those girls

28:43.345 --> 28:46.785
who fawned over you
and flattered you in the past.

28:46.865 --> 28:49.185
She seems kind and pure.

28:49.265 --> 28:50.785
If you two are meant for each other,

28:50.865 --> 28:52.945
don't stick to your outdated beliefs.

28:53.025 --> 28:55.945
Let go of your past prejudices
and try dating her.

28:56.025 --> 28:57.865
That's your prejudice against me.

28:59.105 --> 29:00.945
In your opinion, am I evil or am I a jerk?

29:02.065 --> 29:04.105
I wish you were a jerk.

29:04.625 --> 29:06.825
You need to know your true self.

29:06.905 --> 29:08.825
You are just an arrogant, silly,
and oblivious guy.

29:10.145 --> 29:12.065
Once a girl starts clinging to you,

29:12.145 --> 29:14.065
you immediately turn into
a heartless man who needs no love.

29:16.225 --> 29:17.905
Listen to me.

29:17.985 --> 29:20.585
Love at first sight
or love that never fades

29:20.665 --> 29:21.985
doesn't exist in this world.

29:22.545 --> 29:23.385
Wake up.

29:23.465 --> 29:24.905
Get lost.

29:26.265 --> 29:28.145
Fine. I still have something to do
at my restaurant.

29:28.225 --> 29:29.385
I won't disturb you anymore.

29:30.505 --> 29:31.465
I'm leaving.

29:35.705 --> 29:38.025
Whose… Whose bag is this?

29:40.145 --> 29:41.065
Just leave it there.

29:44.305 --> 29:46.145
Ms. Shang purposely left it here.

29:46.225 --> 29:47.745
She's playing hard to get.

29:48.345 --> 29:49.705
Take your chance when you need to.

29:50.705 --> 29:51.585
Go for it.

29:52.225 --> 29:53.065
I'm leaving.

30:08.425 --> 30:09.305
LUAN NIAN

30:13.425 --> 30:15.025
Answer it. Answer it.

30:18.945 --> 30:19.825
<i>It's Luke.</i>

30:19.905 --> 30:20.745
<i>Where are you?</i>

30:22.065 --> 30:22.945
I'm home.

30:24.745 --> 30:25.945
<i>I'll come find you tonight.</i>

30:26.705 --> 30:27.785
Sure.

30:30.345 --> 30:31.865
What did he say?

30:32.465 --> 30:33.865
He said

30:35.185 --> 30:36.585
he'd come find me tonight.

30:39.465 --> 30:40.825
He's going to confess.

30:42.505 --> 30:44.625
I don't think so.

30:44.705 --> 30:47.905
Regardless, you must
put on full makeup tonight.

30:47.985 --> 30:50.185
Even if you're just taking a stroll,
you must look pretty.

30:50.265 --> 30:51.665
Go. Get changed.

30:51.745 --> 30:52.785
Hurry up.

30:53.425 --> 30:54.705
Stop wasting time.

31:50.025 --> 31:51.345
You've put on makeup.

31:57.945 --> 31:59.785
Why did you ask to meet up?

32:03.305 --> 32:04.425
Are you sober now?

32:12.065 --> 32:13.345
You left your bag at my place.

32:15.785 --> 32:16.865
I forgot.

32:17.585 --> 32:18.825
Thanks.

32:22.345 --> 32:23.505
Sorry.

32:23.585 --> 32:26.225
I made you come all the way here
to return my bag.

32:26.865 --> 32:28.585
Ms. Shang purposely left it here.

32:28.665 --> 32:29.625
She's playing hard to get.

32:31.545 --> 32:33.145
You purposely left your bag at my place

32:33.225 --> 32:34.705
so I'd come and find you.

32:39.905 --> 32:40.865
It wasn't on purpose.

32:44.905 --> 32:46.465
Are you worried that I'd cling to you?

32:57.585 --> 32:58.745
Don't worry.

32:59.585 --> 33:02.905
Last night was just an accident
between two adults.

33:03.705 --> 33:05.785
Thank you again for coming here
to return my bag.

33:06.545 --> 33:07.585
I'm going back.

33:59.425 --> 34:02.785
<i>You purposely left your bag at my place</i>
<i>so I'd come and find you.</i>

34:21.025 --> 34:23.105
Why… Why are you back so soon?

34:27.865 --> 34:29.304
What happened?

34:37.304 --> 34:38.865
I left my bag at his place.

34:38.945 --> 34:40.344
He came to return it.

34:42.905 --> 34:44.744
And he told me

34:46.185 --> 34:47.985
not to get the wrong idea.

34:51.185 --> 34:52.344
What a jerk.

34:52.425 --> 34:53.385
I…

35:02.265 --> 35:03.585
What's done is done.

35:03.665 --> 35:05.145
Stop thinking about it.

35:05.665 --> 35:07.985
People make rash decisions all the time.

35:08.545 --> 35:11.305
He takes advantage of his good looks,
so he sees women as his prey.

35:11.385 --> 35:13.385
Just stay away from him in the future.

35:15.745 --> 35:16.585
Look at me.

35:16.665 --> 35:19.945
Do you know
the three golden rules of modern love?

35:23.545 --> 35:24.945
Don't ask about the past.

35:25.625 --> 35:26.785
Don't gamble on the future.

35:26.865 --> 35:28.905
Cherish the present.

35:31.585 --> 35:33.745
I overestimated myself.

35:34.385 --> 35:38.105
He and I are not from the same world.

35:41.145 --> 35:42.705
I still fell for it.

35:43.745 --> 35:48.225
I didn't want to hear it from him,
so I said it was an accident yesterday.

35:52.745 --> 35:54.225
When it comes to love,

35:54.905 --> 35:57.105
no one is right or wrong.

35:57.705 --> 35:59.385
You think he's experienced,

35:59.905 --> 36:02.985
but he might have gotten hurt once
by a woman as well.

36:03.905 --> 36:05.025
Probably.

36:07.185 --> 36:10.105
I'm just a passerby in his love life.

36:10.185 --> 36:12.145
Tao, cheer up.

36:12.225 --> 36:14.185
Love isn't the only thing in life.

36:25.785 --> 36:27.785
I'll attend English lessons
starting tomorrow.

36:27.865 --> 36:29.545
I'm going to study and improve.

36:29.625 --> 36:30.745
That's right.

36:30.825 --> 36:32.585
Improve and study whenever you can.

36:32.665 --> 36:34.065
Focus on yourself.

36:34.145 --> 36:36.345
Don't let love sidetrack your ambition.

36:36.425 --> 36:38.345
I'm counting on you
to support me in the future.

36:38.905 --> 36:40.865
That's right. I want bread
for tomorrow morning.

36:40.945 --> 36:41.865
Bring some back after class.

36:42.465 --> 36:45.225
To repay you, I can introduce you
to some of our finest clients.

36:45.305 --> 36:47.385
Pick anyone you want.

36:47.465 --> 36:48.665
I don't need you to repay the favor.

36:48.745 --> 36:50.265
Of course I'll bring you bread.

36:51.865 --> 36:52.985
Sure.

36:59.665 --> 37:00.945
Bread is indeed…

37:04.345 --> 37:05.825
more important than love.

37:11.145 --> 37:12.785
<i>You really are a silly and oblivious guy.</i>

37:13.305 --> 37:15.105
<i>I was just saying,</i>
<i>and you actually went and asked her.</i>

37:15.825 --> 37:16.985
<i>Hurry and go make it up to her.</i>

37:24.825 --> 37:27.585
<i>This bag I just sent you</i>
<i>is a limited-edition design.</i>

37:27.665 --> 37:29.865
<i>However, it's already</i>
<i>reserved for a customer.</i>

37:29.945 --> 37:30.985
<i>If you like it, I'll order it for you.</i>

37:31.065 --> 37:32.145
I want this one.

37:32.225 --> 37:33.185
I want it today.

37:33.265 --> 37:35.105
<i>Mr. Luan, this won't do.</i>

37:35.625 --> 37:36.905
<i>This one is for another customer.</i>

37:36.985 --> 37:39.185
<i>For this one, we need to allocate stock</i>
<i>before we can get it from another store.</i>

37:39.265 --> 37:40.745
Do what you must.

37:40.825 --> 37:42.705
If I can get it by today,

37:42.785 --> 37:46.105
I'll buy out your shop's watches,
belts, and cutlery.

37:46.825 --> 37:47.665
I'll come pick them up later.

37:48.465 --> 37:50.265
<i>Sure. I'll think of something.</i>

37:50.345 --> 37:52.945
<i>I'll get everything ready for you</i>
<i>and have someone deliver them to your car.</i>

38:09.585 --> 38:12.145
THE NEXT TRAIN ARRIVES IN ONE MINUTE

38:19.505 --> 38:21.345
It means you gain wisdom
through experience.

38:48.225 --> 38:50.185
SUN YU: DON'T FORGET TO BUY BREAD

38:51.345 --> 38:53.865
Mr. Long, let's end the lesson here.

38:53.945 --> 38:54.785
I still have something to do.

38:56.385 --> 38:57.905
-Let me pay the bill.
-No.

38:57.985 --> 39:00.065
It's my treat today.
You taught me English today.

39:01.185 --> 39:02.865
Let me pay today.

39:02.945 --> 39:07.465
In the next lesson, you can tell me
more about Chinese allusions

39:07.545 --> 39:08.705
to pay me back.

39:08.785 --> 39:11.345
Sure. In the next lesson, I'll tell you

39:11.425 --> 39:13.385
a story about reciprocity
and returning kindness.

39:13.985 --> 39:15.385
I only know the phrase,

39:15.905 --> 39:18.985
"Don't bite the hand that feeds you."

39:19.065 --> 39:21.145
You know quite a lot.

39:21.225 --> 39:22.065
It's nothing much.

39:25.265 --> 39:27.465
HAPPINESS PASTRY

39:29.305 --> 39:30.585
BLACK TRUFFLE MUSHROOM BEEF PUFF
30.6 YUAN

39:30.665 --> 39:31.465
CHEESY CHICKEN BUN, 30.6 YUAN

39:31.545 --> 39:32.705
BIRTHDAY PARTY HAT

39:33.465 --> 39:34.945
Why are they so expensive?

39:38.905 --> 39:41.025
HALF PRICE AT 9 P.M. EVERY NIGHT

39:45.025 --> 39:46.385
SUN YU

39:51.025 --> 39:52.145
Sun Yu.

39:52.225 --> 39:54.985
The bread here is half price after nine.

39:55.065 --> 39:56.865
What do you want? I'll buy them for you.

39:59.665 --> 40:00.945
Sure.

40:04.425 --> 40:06.305
LUAN NIAN: ARE YOU STILL AT HOME?

40:20.385 --> 40:23.385
<i>They say the heart is a narrow door.</i>

40:23.465 --> 40:26.745
<i>Once you get hurt,</i>
<i>it'll leave a crack that gets in the way.</i>

40:28.385 --> 40:30.385
<i>When your sincerity</i>
<i>is being taken lightly,</i>

40:30.465 --> 40:32.385
<i>it's worse than getting hurt physically.</i>

40:32.905 --> 40:35.465
<i>The soft thorn deep in my heart,</i>

40:35.545 --> 40:37.025
<i>once touched, brings embarrassment.</i>

40:37.545 --> 40:39.665
<i>Just thinking about it</i>
<i>makes me feel disheartened.</i>

40:45.865 --> 40:46.905
Dear customers,

40:46.985 --> 40:49.905
our freshly baked bread
will be sold at half price soon.

40:49.985 --> 40:52.625
If you are interested,
please proceed to the bread area.

40:52.705 --> 40:53.585
HAPPINESS PASTRY

41:09.625 --> 41:10.505
Luke?

41:10.585 --> 41:11.745
Why are you here?

41:11.825 --> 41:13.385
Can I help you?

41:30.825 --> 41:31.665
It's for you.

41:43.025 --> 41:44.585
I don't need this.

41:46.385 --> 41:47.945
That bag of yours is too old.

41:48.025 --> 41:48.905
Use a new one.

41:50.865 --> 41:53.105
This bag is good enough.

41:53.185 --> 41:54.345
I don't need to change it.

41:55.185 --> 41:56.585
Don't worry.

41:57.705 --> 42:00.065
What happened two days ago
was an accident.

42:01.265 --> 42:02.265
You're afraid of being pestered.

42:03.065 --> 42:04.385
And I'm also quite busy.

42:07.425 --> 42:08.785
Is that what you think?

42:13.465 --> 42:15.465
There's nothing more to it.

42:16.185 --> 42:17.345
Don't worry.

42:17.425 --> 42:19.185
I'm a pragmatist.

42:19.265 --> 42:21.505
Between work and love,
I'll surely choose work.

42:23.665 --> 42:24.585
In the future,

42:25.825 --> 42:26.985
let's just…

42:30.625 --> 42:32.345
forget this ever happened.

42:32.425 --> 42:33.785
Let's just be strangers.

42:35.865 --> 42:36.985
You care a lot about this job.

42:39.065 --> 42:39.905
Of course.

42:40.945 --> 42:44.705
I hope this incident
won't affect your opinion of my work.

42:45.825 --> 42:46.745
It won't.

42:51.545 --> 42:52.465
That's good to hear.

42:56.585 --> 42:57.625
You may go back.

42:58.345 --> 43:00.905
This bag is too expensive.
It's not suitable for me.

43:04.385 --> 43:07.865
So even without accepting the bag,
you still want to date me?

43:28.505 --> 43:29.905
We are…

43:32.865 --> 43:35.385
not in an official relationship.

43:36.945 --> 43:37.785
Tao…

43:39.105 --> 43:43.305
What is an official relationship
in this day and age?

43:43.385 --> 43:46.705
A sincere promise or a fake confession?

43:46.785 --> 43:49.385
Love is always complicated.

43:49.465 --> 43:51.705
Even if it's planned,
it's not necessarily fake.

43:51.785 --> 43:54.625
Even if you're discussing marriage,
it might still not be true love.

43:56.105 --> 43:58.145
He is my boss.

43:59.105 --> 44:02.385
When I joined the company,
he asked me to quit on my first day.

44:02.465 --> 44:04.185
I was very nervous back then.

44:07.985 --> 44:10.945
I felt that he wasn't joking
when he said that.

44:11.025 --> 44:11.985
Did you offend him?

44:13.905 --> 44:15.305
Then I'm sure he is interested in you.

44:15.865 --> 44:17.505
I don't think so.

44:18.225 --> 44:20.345
He doesn't seem like someone
who lacks girlfriends.

44:22.385 --> 44:25.345
In his eyes, I'm probably

44:27.145 --> 44:29.545
a person made up entirely of flaws.

44:30.625 --> 44:34.185
I should probably focus
on how to survive in Lime.
